OL,3,GNEWSAVillage cricket club set for
OL,4,ALord's showdown
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You dream of being a professional
OL,7,Fcricketer for England, but this is
OL,8,Fsecond only to that," says Captain
OL,9,FRichard Bostock.
OL,11,FA village cricket club in Cuckney,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, is playing its
OL,13,Ffirst-ever Cawston Press Village Cup
OL,14,FFinal at Lord's on Sunday, when they
OL,15,Fwill face four-time winners Blackheath
OL,16,Ffrom Surrey.
OL,18,FIt will be the second time in three
OL,19,Fyears that Cuckney has had a team
OL,20,Fplaying at Lord's, following the First
OL,21,FXI's National Club Championship triumph
OL,22,Fin 2023.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
